{"id":"vod_sn_38766","vodId":"38766","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔术快斗","name_cn":"魔术快斗","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9c9b1220e10a77c36822bae2940fc99a.jpg"},"summary":"白色斗篷、高礼帽，单片夹鼻眼镜。出现在午夜的高楼，留下拿走宝石的通知函。这是我们熟知的怪盗基德。在《名侦探柯南》里，他是不亚于工藤新一和江户川柯南的明星人物。而他的真实身份则是高中生黑羽快斗（山口胜平 配音），为了调查父亲的失踪事件，扮起了父亲之前扮演的角色——怪盗基德，希望引出神秘组织的出现，进而调查出事情的真相。　　《魔术快斗》首次连载在《少年SUNDAY》上是1987年，中途停载了数次，至今仍未完结。号称杂志上连载时间最长的漫画。由于怪盗基德经常性在柯南里客串，以至于很多人都误认为这是柯南的原创人物，其实基德有其正篇漫画，从其诞生时间来看，他比柯南更早出现，漫画里则有很多奇幻因素，而基德的性格也有所不同。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/TkywnNh5hD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/1QupZuP5Cr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/3Yq24A9XV51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/d4Fj8b88ew1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/8rbiKmEZGc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/rNPJu2m94p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/UEQU6Mxg8F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/5mUfkMDWff1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/9x95zVyKux1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/a9CWj5YRd61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/8zGh73HpeD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Y8Vyfe0YYi1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.863Z"}